msg.passwordRecoveryHint=Note: If you have forgotten your username, open the Laplink Internet console on your PC, select "Configure->Users and Sharing" and look at the "Me" entry.

mail.newAccountSubject=[Laplink Internet] Thank you for signing up!
mail.newAccountFrom=support@laplink.com
mail.newAccountBody=Thank you again for signing up for Laplink Internet.\n\nFor your convenience, here are some tips on how to access\nyour PC's.\n\n-Install Laplink Gold on each PC you wish to access.\n\n-Run Laplink Gold on those PCs and when prompted to register\n   select Yes and perform the registration steps provided\n\n\nIf you require further assistance, please contact Laplink technical support at http://www.laplink.com/support/laplink.asp.\n\nRegards,\nLaplink Internet Support\nsupport@laplink.com\n

